// HAND-WRITTEN — not generated by `tools/kt_generate.py`, which only writes the factions on
// Warhammer Community's download list.
//
// NOCTURNE'S RELIC SEEKERS (Salamanders) — a homebrew kill team, transcribed from
// https://ktdash.app/killteams/HBR-XRqxC-1 via that site's JSON API.
//
// Three things the source needed, and each is the same trap `companions.ts` hit:
//   - It lists 17 equipment entries, 13 of which are the UNIVERSAL equipment the app already
//     ships. Only the four faction ones are here.
//   - `Astartes` and `Close-range Eradication` are repeated on all nine operatives rather than
//     flagged `isFactionRule`. They are faction cards here, and off the datacards, so the Rules
//     deck states them once instead of the Ops deck stating them nine times.
//   - Weapon rules are abbreviated on KTDash (`Rng 8", Sat, Tor 2"`, `PrcCrit1`). They are
//     expanded to the glossary's own names so `weaponRules` can resolve them.
//
// Otherwise verbatim, minus two edits: the `MPERIUM` typo in two keyword lines, and the markdown
// table in Promethean Tooth Dagger, flattened to a line because card bodies render plain text.
//
// No `acts`/`kv`: nothing in this team's rules doubles activations or kill value, unlike the
// Custodes. No DEFAULT_ROSTER either — the composition offers choices, so the GM picks.
